<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ssh on 星双</title><link>https://jzjizhe.github.io/tags/ssh/</link><description>Recent content in Ssh on 星双</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:35:20 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jzjizhe.github.io/tags/ssh/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SSH转发让A server使用B server的代理</title><link>https://jzjizhe.github.io/tool/ssh%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E8%AE%A9a-server%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8b-server%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://jzjizhe.github.io/tool/ssh%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E8%AE%A9a-server%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8b-server%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>The note is generated by &amp;ldquo;chatGPT&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>当希望 &lt;strong>A 服务器借用 B 服务器的代理网络&lt;/strong>（例如 Clash/Mihomo 的 7890 端口）时，可以使用 SSH 的端口转发（&lt;code>ssh -L&lt;/code>）来实现。&lt;br>
最终效果是：&lt;/p>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>A 访问 127.0.0.1:本地端口 → 通过 SSH 转发到 B:7890 → B 的 Clash 提供代理功能
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="1-前提条件">1️⃣ 前提条件&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>A 可以 SSH 登录 B&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>SSH自动登录与debug</title><link>https://jzjizhe.github.io/tool/ssh%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%8Edebug/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://jzjizhe.github.io/tool/ssh%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%8Edebug/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>The note is generated by &amp;ldquo;DeepSeek&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="一基础设置步骤">一、基础设置步骤&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="1-生成-ssh-密钥对客户端">1. 生成 SSH 密钥对（客户端）&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ssh-keygen -t rsa -b &lt;span style="color:#0550ae">4096&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#57606a"># 默认保存位置：~/.ssh/id_rsa (私钥) 和 ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub (公钥)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="2-复制公钥到服务器">2. 复制公钥到服务器&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>方法一：使用 ssh-copy-id（推荐）&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Proxy set, but ssh -T git@github.com fails</title><link>https://jzjizhe.github.io/git/proxy-set-but-ssh--t-git@github.com-fails/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://jzjizhe.github.io/git/proxy-set-but-ssh--t-git@github.com-fails/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>The note is generated by ChatGPT.&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="observation--proxy-set-but-ssh-still-fails">&lt;strong>Observation — Proxy set, but SSH still fails&lt;/strong>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Although you set &lt;code>http_proxy&lt;/code> / &lt;code>https_proxy&lt;/code> (or &lt;code>all_proxy&lt;/code>), running:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ssh -T git@github.com
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>still times out or fails.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="root-cause--ssh-does-not-use-the-http-proxy--key-point">&lt;strong>Root cause — SSH does NOT use the HTTP proxy&lt;/strong> (key point)&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Terminal HTTP/SOCKS environment variables affect HTTP/HTTPS-aware programs (curl, wget, &lt;code>git clone https://…&lt;/code>, etc.), but &lt;strong>OpenSSH does not honor those variables&lt;/strong>. SSH opens a raw TCP connection and must be explicitly told to use a proxy — otherwise it tries a direct connection and gets blocked by the network/firewall.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Git配置SSH Key</title><link>https://jzjizhe.github.io/git/git%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEssh-key/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://jzjizhe.github.io/git/git%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEssh-key/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>The note is generated by 豆包.&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="一配置目的">一、配置目的&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>通过 SSH Key 实现与远程仓库（GitHub/GitLab/Gitee 等）的&lt;strong>无密码安全连接&lt;/strong>，避免每次操作远程仓库时重复输入账号密码。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="二操作步骤">二、操作步骤&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="1-检查本地是否已存在-ssh-key">1. 检查本地是否已存在 SSH Key&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>首先确认本地是否已有生成好的 SSH Key，避免重复创建。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>